graph TD
  V1["View: user activates a server action;<br/>start attempt, arm bound timer"]
  S1["Server: accept request, then start<br/>deadline, signal, terminal gate"]
  S2["Server: authenticate, then work;<br/>deadline still runs after headers"]
  S3["Server: first of result, deadline<br/>or disconnect decides;<br/>one response, or none"]
  V2["View: answer arrives"]
  V3["Attempt current:<br/>present result"]
  V4["Attempt retired:<br/>drop answer"]
  T["View: new selection, label loss,<br/>bound expiry or host teardown"]
  V5["View: retire attempt, stop timer,<br/>abort resource request,<br/>release client-held resource"]
  N["Retiring does not guarantee<br/>the server stops"]
  V1 -->|request sent| S1
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 -->|if a response is delivered| V2
  V2 --> V3
  V2 --> V4
  T --> V5
  V5 -.-> N
